  "article": "<article\nclass=\"post-2627 page type-page status-publish ast-article-single\" id=\"post-2627\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/CreativeWork\" itemscope=\"itemscope\"><header class=\"entry-header ast-no-thumbnail ast-no-title ast-header-without-markup\"></header><div class=\"entry-content clear\"\n data-ast-blocks-layout=\"true\" itemprop=\"text\"><div class=\"wp-block-ugb-container ugb-container ugb-b2bb40a ugb-container--v2 ugb-container--design-basic ugb-main-block\"><style>.ugb-b2bb40a-wrapper.ugb-container__wrapper{border-radius:0px !important;min-height:50vh;background-image:url(/media/2020/11/haushoppe-stage.jpg)}.ugb-b2bb40a-wrapper.ugb-container__wrapper:before{opacity:0.5}@media screen and (min-width:768px){.ugb-b2bb40a.ugb-container{margin-top:0px !important}}</style><div class=\"ugb-inner-block\"><div class=\"ugb-block-content\"><div class=\"ugb-container__wrapper ugb-b2bb40a-wrapper ugb--shadow-0 ugb--has-background-overlay\"><div class=\"ugb-container__side\"><div class=\"ugb-container__content-wrapper ugb-b2bb40a-content-wrapper\"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-ugb-container ugb-container ugb-d85371e ugb-container--v2 ugb-container--design-basic ugb-main-block ugb--has-custom-content-width\"><div class=\"ugb-inner-block\"><div class=\"ugb-block-content\"><div class=\"ugb-container__wrapper ugb-d85371e-wrapper ugb--shadow-0\"><div class=\"ugb-container__side\"><div class=\"ugb-container__content-wrapper ugb-d85371e-content-wrapper\"><h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:28px\">Art &#8211; an expression of creative power.</h1><div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"alignright size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"/en/portfolio/from-the-center-to-the-edge-and-back-2023/\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/media/2023/08/2023-01-A-Olaf-Hoppe-„Aus-dem-Zentrum-an-den-Rand-und-zurueck-2023-Acryl-auf-Leiwnand-120-x-200cm_-1024x618.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5191\" width=\"478\" height=\"287\" srcset=\"/media/2023/08/2023-01-A-Olaf-Hoppe-„Aus-dem-Zentrum-an-den-Rand-und-zurueck-2023-Acryl-auf-Leiwnand-120-x-200cm_-1024x618.jpg 1024w, /media/2023/08/2023-01-A-Olaf-Hoppe-„Aus-dem-Zentrum-an-den-Rand-und-zurueck-2023-Acryl-auf-Leiwnand-120-x-200cm_-300x181.jpg 300w, /media/2023/08/2023-01-A-Olaf-Hoppe-„Aus-dem-Zentrum-an-den-Rand-und-zurueck-2023-Acryl-auf-Leiwnand-120-x-200cm_-768x463.jpg 768w, /media/2023/08/2023-01-A-Olaf-Hoppe-„Aus-dem-Zentrum-an-den-Rand-und-zurueck-2023-Acryl-auf-Leiwnand-120-x-200cm_-1536x927.jpg 1536w, /media/2023/08/2023-01-A-Olaf-Hoppe-„Aus-dem-Zentrum-an-den-Rand-und-zurueck-2023-Acryl-auf-Leiwnand-120-x-200cm_-2048x1236.jpg 2048w, /media/2023/08/2023-01-A-Olaf-Hoppe-„Aus-dem-Zentrum-an-den-Rand-und-zurueck-2023-Acryl-auf-Leiwnand-120-x-200cm_-1280x772.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 478px) 100vw, 478px\" /></a><figcaption><a href=\"/en/portfolio/from-the-center-to-the-edge-and-back-2023/\">&#8220;From the center to the edge and back again&#8221; 2023</a></figcaption></figure></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">From 1980 &#8211; 1985 I studied at the university Berlin Weißensee. During this time we, my wife and I, bought an old farmhouse on the Baltic coast, which we converted into a gallery and workshop. On an exhibition area of approx. 400 m² you can now view or purchase numerous paintings and multi-coloured woodcuts.</p><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">During your visit, take the opportunity to participate in a guided tour of HAUS HOPPE &#8211; Galerie für Bildende Kunst, where you will be introduced to the artist&#8217;s oeuvre and have your questions answered about his craft, composition, art and art history. Experience my precious woodcuts about which the international gallery ARTES® writes: &#8220;&#8230;The painter and graphic artist Olaf <a href=\"/media/2020/12/Artes-1.jpg\">Hoppe is one of the best woodcutters in Germany&#8230;&#8221;</a>.</p><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Welcome to my gallery<br><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"181\" class=\"wp-image-2145\" style=\"width: 300px;\" src=\"/media/2021/05/unterschrift.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/media/2021/05/unterschrift.jpg 900w, /media/2021/05/unterschrift-300x181.jpg 300w, /media/2021/05/unterschrift-768x464.jpg 768w, /media/2021/05/unterschrift-500x302.jpg 500w, /media/2021/05/unterschrift-800x484.jpg 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /><br>Olaf Hoppe</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></article>"
}